{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37781","headline":"奔问三峰寓止近墅 · 郑谷","name":"奔问三峰寓止近墅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"半年奔走颇惊魂，来谒行宫泪眼昏。\n鸳鹭入朝同待漏，牛羊送日独归村。\n灞陵散失诗千首，太华凄凉酒一樽。\n兵革未休无异术，不知何以受君恩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑谷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37781.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37781","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}